short_description:
1. Built-in IR and LED light, freely switch illumination mode;
2. 16:9 6MP resolution;
3. Record colorful events triggered by AI detection；
4. Illumination by schedule, using different mode at different time
5. SMD Plus by default to detect human and vehicle, filter out false alarm.
6. Perimeter Protection, which support the classification and accurate detection of vehicle and human

